        "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A mahjong game similar to the &quot;Joker&quot; card game, featuring pigeons as the playing pieces.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Players must win within the specified number of draws and achieve the required score for each level to progress. The game features diverse level restrictions, allowing players to learn skills and enhance their deck through enchantments. By completing various levels set by the game, players can experience endless variations in gameplay through the combination of different skills and enchantment effects, creating unexpected and astonishing outcomes. Players can utilize skill combinations from different schools to score remarkably high points, ensuring continuous surprises and exploration throughout the game. A well-designed player progression system enables players to continually grow stronger and challenge the limits of scoring!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><u>Creatively designed levels</u></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Level design is divided into regular levels and endless mode, with each level featuring unique constraints. Players must employ corresponding skill combinations tailored to these constraints to progress through the levels.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3828700/extras/8c1183ffe83445dd934ad870f6f87166.avif?t=1764905640\" width=800 height=450 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><u>The ever-changing combination of skills</u></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >64 unpredictable skills have been designed based on the 64 hexagrams in the traditional Chinese culture of the Book of Changes, with multiple skill combinations unleashing infinite possibilities.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3828700/extras/204c1f27f143a0714d0ec50096aa830b.avif?t=1764905640\" width=800 height=450 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><u>A fun enchanting system</u></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Players can enchant their own tile library, making each mahjong tile incredibly powerful. Can you imagine how powerful the entire four-star tile library is?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3828700/extras/7e06f346d9d65281bab82cdad93cafee.avif?t=1764905640\" width=800 height=450 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3828700/extras/749b466910f13d289d4ffb5faeca6bed.avif?t=1764905640\" width=1560 height=778 /></span></p>",
        "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A mahjong game similar to the &quot;Joker&quot; card game, featuring pigeons as the playing pieces.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Players must win within the specified number of draws and achieve the required score for each level to progress. The game features diverse level restrictions, allowing players to learn skills and enhance their deck through enchantments. By completing various levels set by the game, players can experience endless variations in gameplay through the combination of different skills and enchantment effects, creating unexpected and astonishing outcomes. Players can utilize skill combinations from different schools to score remarkably high points, ensuring continuous surprises and exploration throughout the game. A well-designed player progression system enables players to continually grow stronger and challenge the limits of scoring!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><u>Creatively designed levels</u></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Level design is divided into regular levels and endless mode, with each level featuring unique constraints. Players must employ corresponding skill combinations tailored to these constraints to progress through the levels.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3828700/extras/8c1183ffe83445dd934ad870f6f87166.avif?t=1764905640\" width=800 height=450 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><u>The ever-changing combination of skills</u></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >64 unpredictable skills have been designed based on the 64 hexagrams in the traditional Chinese culture of the Book of Changes, with multiple skill combinations unleashing infinite possibilities.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3828700/extras/204c1f27f143a0714d0ec50096aa830b.avif?t=1764905640\" width=800 height=450 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><u>A fun enchanting system</u></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Players can enchant their own tile library, making each mahjong tile incredibly powerful. Can you imagine how powerful the entire four-star tile library is?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3828700/extras/7e06f346d9d65281bab82cdad93cafee.avif?t=1764905640\" width=800 height=450 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3828700/extras/749b466910f13d289d4ffb5faeca6bed.avif?t=1764905640\" width=1560 height=778 /></span></p>",
